  "Question": "In a Cartesian coordinate plane, points $A(-1,2)$ and $A'(7,2)$ are reflections of each other across the line $x=m$. Find the value of $m$.",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "3",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The axis of reflection perpendicularly bisects $AA'$. Thus, $m$ is the horizontal coordinate of the midpoint of $AA'$, so $m=(-1+7)/2=3$.",
